We conduct remote sessions with clients. The first issue is a login problem. To resolve this, we perform the following steps: start the software > go to master > employees > search for the specific employee > select the employee > edit employee > go to the 'level' option > unselect 'allow assign' > save, then reselect 'allow assign'.

Another issue is that leave is not showing in the user login for DT0675 employee. The leave codes (CL - 01, SL - 05, C-OFF, ALWP) are not displayed in the system. To address this, we take a remote session of the server system and run the following SQL commands:

Insert into elve values (05, 'design', '00DT0675', 'SL', 05, 'Bhrch');
Insert into elve values (01, 'design', '00DT0675', 'CL', 01, 'Bhrch');

