1. The client reported an issue where a wrong miss punch was applied, and they were unable to delete the application.
2. Upon attempting to delete the miss punch from the front-end attendance sheet, I encountered a "restrictions applied" error.
3. I proceeded to access the database and executed the following query to locate and delete the miss punch application.
SELECT * FROM EmpMaster WHERE Code='115517'
SELECT * FROM adjustapply(nolock) WHERE userid='18696' AND attddate='2021/11/17' AND category = 'mispunch';
delete FROM adjustapply WHERE userid='18696' AND attddate='2021/11/17' AND category = 'mispunch';

